      "raw_output": "{\"result\":{\"status\":\"ANSWER\",\"answer_parts\":[{\"text\":\"Use the Socket Gateway version that matches your Netcool/OMNIbus release. For Netcool/OMNIbus V8.1, use the newer Socket Gateway package; it contains versions for all supported operating systems. The Passport Advantage part number is CN6I1EN.\",\"support_ids\":[\"E1.S7\",\"E1.S8\",\"E1.S9\",\"E1.S10\"]},{\"text\":\"For Netcool/OMNIbus V7.4.0, use the separate Socket Gateway package for the target operating system. The documented package part numbers are CN6GZEN (AIX), CN6H1EN (HP-UX on Itanium), CN6H2EN (Linux), CN6H3EN (Linux for zSeries), CN6H4EN (Solaris), and CN6H5EN (Windows).\",\"support_ids\":[\"E1.S11\",\"E1.S12\",\"E1.S13\"]},{\"text\":\"The supplied evidence does not explicitly map the filenames nco-g-socket-java-2_0 and nco-g-socket-10_0 to those product versions, so the filename alone should not be used as the selection criterion.\",\"support_ids\":[\"E1.S7\",\"E1.S10\",\"E1.S11\",\"E1.S12\"]}]}}",
